title: TestBranching_Start
---
<<if $hasTalked>>
<<jump TestBranching_HasTalked>>
<<else>>
<<jump TestBranching_HasNotTalked>>
<<endif>>
<<stop>>
===

title: TestBranching_HasNotTalked
---
Knud: We have not talked before.
Jorgen: Lets set has talked variable to true.
<<set $hasTalked = true>>
Knud: ok. lets do that
<<stop>>
===

title: TestBranching_HasTalked
---
Knud: Have we talked already?
Jorgen: Yes! has talked variable is set to true.
Knud: nice!
<<stop>>
